{"id":8859736342727,"title":"Personalized Colorful Yggdrasil Tree of Life Quilt Sets - Yggdrasil","handle":"personalized-colorful-yggdrasil-tree-of-life-quilt-sets-yggdrasil","description":"\u003cp\u003eWelcome timeless elegance and comfort into your home with the Jeminise Tree of Life Quilt Set. This beautiful bedding set features the symbolic Yggdrasil design, bringing resilience and interconnectedness to your sanctuary. It's an ideal choice for adding a touch of meaningful artistry and cozy warmth to any bedroom.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMeaningful Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Showcases the amazing Yggdrasil Tree of Life, symbolizing resilience, strength, and interconnectedness.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offered in Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches) to perfectly fit your bed.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Functional as a bedding set or a cozy wrap for relaxing on the sofa, suitable for indoor and outdoor use in all seasons.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThoughtful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e A perfect and practical present for housewarmings, weddings, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Christmas, or for beloved family members like moms, dads, sisters, brothers, and more.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable in cold water and air dry without heat, ensuring the microfiber remains fluffy and easy to maintain.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e This set includes 1 Quilt, with an optional Pillowcase available.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Style:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features a minimalist style with specially designed colorful themes on smooth material.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eBrand\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eJeminise\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eProduct Type\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eQuilt Sets\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003ePattern\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eTree of Life\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eTheme\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eTree of Life\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eColor\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eColorful Tree of Life\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eStyle\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eMinimalist\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eMaterial\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePolycotton\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFabric Type\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCotton, Polyester\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eAvailable Sizes\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eThrow(60x70 inches), Twin(68x86 inches), Full(80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), King (91x102 inches)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eIncluded Components\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e1 Quilt + Pillowcase (Optional)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eCustomization\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e1 text input\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eCare Instructions\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eMachine Wash\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\u003c\/table\u003e","published_at":"2026-08-12T16:24:40-05:00","created_at":"2026-08-12T16:18:22-05:00","vendor":"Jeminise","type":"Quilt Sets","tags":["amazon-import","amazon-parent-b0dnq35hcn","Christmas Day","Couple Blanket","Dad Gift","Family Blanket","Mom Gift","Persona